    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 676244225140074482, guid: 2290421a90386fe40b7a4497c38b7323, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteContent
      value: 'TO ANYONE WHO FINDS THIS,




        Emergency fuel reserves were
        moved into this room after the lower storage flooded, and they were never
        intended for regular use. They should only be touched if power restoration
        becomes necessary.

        If you are up here to turn on the generator,
        then time is already running out. Sector Null has started reacting to the
        blackout, and that is never a good sign.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
